    "updated_at": "2026-11-11T15:26:14Z",
    "body": "Another follow-up, from the delta reviews of PRs #823 and #833: dropped `plate`/`on_plate` keys (`plate_dto::link_from`, and the names `drop_dangling` returns are discarded at `project/apply.rs:822`) and dropped `mod_jaw` keys (`modvise_dto::params_from`) only reach the log. Pass `notes` into both so they show in the user's load notes, like #812's vise and accessory drops. Also, `modvise_dto.rs:9`'s doc still says it will move onto `fixture_keys` \"when it lands\"; it has landed.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
    "pin": null,
